    "Jokuo ge ariyo moko bende ne giguro kode, achielebade kor achwich to machieloebade kor acham.",
    "Joma ne kadho kanyo ne gigoyo wigi kachare kendo weche mag yanye duto,",
    "kawacho ni, “In manyocha iwacho ni inyalo ketho Hekalu kendo igere ndalo adekni, resri ane koro! Kaponi in Wuod Nyasaye, lor piny ia ewi msalaba!”",
    "Jodolo madongo gi jopuonj chikekindgi giwegi bende nochare kargi. Ne giwacho ni,",
    "“Nokonyo jomoko to en iwuon to ok onyal konyore owuon! En Ruodh Israel! Lor koro piny iaemsalabani sani, eka wayie kuome sani!",
    "Nogeno Nyasaye. We Ruoth konyne koro sani kaponi ohere adier, nimar nowacho ni, ‘An Wuod Nyasaye’ ”.",
    "Jok mane ogur kode bende nodhuole koso machalre kargi.",
    "Kar saa auchiel, mudho noimo piny duto nyaka saa ochiko.",
    "Ka saa ochiko noromo Yesu noywak gi dwol maduong' kowacho ni, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakthani?” ma tiende ni, “Nyasacha, Nyasacha, iweya nang'o?”",
    "Ka moko kuomgi manochungo machiegni nowinjo, ne giwacho ni, “Oluongo Elija.”",
    "Nga'to achiel noringo mopong'o siponj gi kong'a wayo, koting'eeluth mondo omadhi.",
    "To mamoko to ne gibedo ling' kawacho ni, “Wee, wane kaponi Elija biro reso.”",
    "Yesu noywak matek kendo mar ariyo, kendo chunye nochot duto.",
    "Pasia mar Hekalu notierore nyadiriyo aa malo nyaka piny. Piny noyiengre, kendo lwendni obre tindo,",
    "kendo liete duto noyawore, kendo ringre joma kar moko duto duto o-chier o-oa malo,",
    "kendo ka Yesu osechier ne giwuokeliete duto modonjoeDala Maler, kendo ji mang'eny nonenogi.",
    "To jatend askeche gi joma ne ni kode duto karito Yesu kane oneno piny ka yiengre kendo gik moko duto mane otimore, ne gipong' gi luoro maduong' mi giwacho ni, “Adier chuth En Wuod Nyasaye!”",
    "Ne nitie mon moko mang'eny bende kanyo, mane ng'icho gichien. Mongi ema noluwo Yesu koa Galili kepidhe kargi.",
    "Moro kuomgi ne gin Maria Magdala gi Maria min Jakobo matin, ma bende min Jose, kod Salome wuon Zebedi.",
    "Ka nochopo odhiambo, jamoko moro moa Arimathaya, manyinge Josef, mane en bende achiel kuom jopuonjre Yesu, nobiro.",
